OL,3,GNEWSACritically ill girl visits
OL,4,A'magical' Disney event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old Disney fan with complex
OL,7,Fhealth conditions was left filled with
OL,8,Fjoy after she was invited to a special
OL,9,Fevent for children too ill to travel
OL,10,Fabroad.
OL,12,FElla, from Leicestershire, attended A
OL,13,FDisney Wish, organised by Make-A-Wish
OL,14,FUK and Disney, where she met
OL,15,Fprincesses, Toy Story characters and
OL,16,Fwatched a Frozen-themed show.
OL,18,FHer mother Hayley, said the event felt
OL,19,Fjust "like you're at Disneyland", and
OL,20,Fthe most special moment was when Ella
OL,21,Fwatched a show based on the film
OL,22,FFrozen.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
