OL,3,GNEWSACritically ill girl visits
OL,4,A'magical' Disney event
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Ella was full of smiles," she said.
OL,7,F"It was pure excitement and joy. It
OL,8,Fmelted me. I couldn't believe how
OL,9,Famazing it was."
